{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55042","headline":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 九 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占梦第二十五（京本列第十三○九首） 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军梦，梦见大舟船。\n顺水顺风帆幔顺，战之获捷独爲先，快乐（辛本、川本作「不尔」）似神仙。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}